            <ArticleTitle>Preprocessed Consortium for Neuropsychiatric Phenomics dataset.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1262</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.12688/f1000research.11964.1</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Here we present preprocessed MRI data of 265 participants from the Consortium for Neuropsychiatric Phenomics (CNP) dataset. The preprocessed dataset includes minimally preprocessed data in the native, MNI and surface spaces accompanied with potential confound regressors, tissue probability masks, brain masks and transformations. In addition the preprocessed dataset includes unthresholded group level and single subject statistical maps from all tasks included in the original dataset. We hope that availability of this dataset will greatly accelerate research.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
